Z||000001||California Kid||09-14-2001||04:50 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Alex4mula:<BR><B><BR>My question is, How many coils did you cut front and rear for that drop? Thanks.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Suspension work was done by Keith Huff of Fiero Motorsports in California before I bought the car. Keith told me that only a small section was removed from the lower portion of the coil at all four corners.<P>You might try to contact him through his web site: <A HREF="http://linkline.com/personal/lvumlow/fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://linkline.com/personal/lvumlow/fiero.html</A> <BR>If you reach Keith also ask him if he has the records on which 4 wheel alignment, caster, and camber settings he used. If he has them, you may want to share this information with the rest of us.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature_5.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by California Kid (edited 09-14-2001).]||||reg||1
