Z||000005||California Kid||09-15-2001||11:26 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by WKDFIRO:<BR><B><BR>If you were the guy that bought Charlie's car Im the one who "escorted" you onto the 91 freeway!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>I'm the guy....Charlie and I still swap some notes once in a while, he's just blown away with what I've done to the car, he's sorry he sold it.<P>Nice to hear from you.  Due to weather on the trip back, I didn't stop until I reached St. Louis, almost was snowed in at Flagstaff. Spent 4 hrs in snow because they were going to shut the freeway down for a couple days, so I keep moving, cars in the ditch over over the place. Was nice meeting all the guy's at FOCOA, although I really don't remember which one you are (had a lot on my mind at the time).<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/DSCF0249b.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/California_Kid_2.jpg"> <BR>I believe Artherd: Ben knows how to reach Keith Huff, think he talked to him recently.<P>||||reg||1
